---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy">
  <section class="hero container prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>This is a static website. We do not run application servers or user accounts on this site.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Hosting logs</strong> — AWS CloudFront may log IP address, browser, and pages requested (standard CDN access logs).</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics / ads</strong> — If you enable ads in <a href="/ads.html">Ad settings</a>, Google AdSense may load scripts and use cookies per <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>. Ads are <strong>off by default</strong>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What stays in your browser only</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Progress tracker</strong> — lab completion checkmarks and notes (localStorage)</li>
      <li><strong>Ad settings</strong> — your AdSense client ID and on/off toggle (localStorage, not sent to us)</li>
      <li><strong>Certificate name</strong> — optional display name for your completion certificate</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>User accounts or login credentials</li>
      <li>Kubernetes credentials or cloud account access</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Open a GitHub issue on the repository for questions or data requests.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
